# Prada L'Homme Intense-inspired — Iris / Amber Interior — Astra V1

Formula ID: PLI-ASTRA-V1. Date: 2026-09-05. Original inspired design; immediate parent formula: NONE.
Status: COMPLETE DEVELOPMENT DESIGN / NOT COMPOUNDED / NOT RELEASED.
Astra parent is the designer and final computational reviewer. No similarity percentage, liking score, skin-life estimate, or proprietary formula claim is made.

## 1. Authority, concentration and accounting

This is a complete proposal, not authorization to manufacture or apply to skin. Masses are nominal design values, exact arithmetically from the declared stock fractions, conditional on label truth, homogeneous stocks and recorded weighings. Neat/as supplied is not a certificate of analytical purity.

The master is 6.000 g by mass, not 6.000 mL. Its 3.808 g fragrant supplied-product subtotal is 63.4667% of that master; 2.192 g is declared stock carrier. Proprietary bases and the natural oil are counted as supplied products, not pure molecular odorants. Their internal solvents/constituents are not known.

The requested nominal 30 mL / 20% convention means a measured 6.00 mL homogeneous concentrate aliquot, then perfumer's ethanol quantity sufficient to a final 30.00 mL at a recorded temperature. It does not mean 20% w/w, nor 20% pure odorants. Record the aliquot mass m6; the exact dose scaling is m6 / 6.000 g. Alternatively prepare a larger proportional master and transfer the measured aliquot. A 6 g master is not guaranteed to provide 6 mL.

Exact finished-product mass ppm require final bottle mass M: ppm_i = m6_g * (product_mg_i / 6000) / M_g * 1,000,000. Stock density is unnecessary for the weighed master, but necessary to publish valid individual raw microlitres. Authoritative raw µL and literal active µL are UNKNOWN for this card. Do not interpret the separate diagnostic projection as a dosing card.

## 2. Named reference and protected identity

The advertised Intense architecture joins floral iris to amber, patchouli, tonka and sandalwood. The house campaign places iris against intensified amber/patchouli and describes an airy dimension from tonka. These are note claims, not disclosures of the commercial ingredients or ratios. Sources: [Prada product](https://www.prada.com/ww/en/p/lhomme-prada-intense-edp-100-ml/2A1252_2HC1_F0Z99_P_ML100), [Prada Intense campaign](https://www.prada.com/us/en/pradasphere/fragrances/la-femme-et-l-homme-prada/la-femme-et-l-homme-prada-intense.html), accessed 2026-09-05.

Design interpretation: cool tailored iris outside, warm dry tonka-sandalwood inside, with patchouli supplying shadow rather than mud. A small suede seam connects root and wood. Leather is NOT named on the inspected official pages; Suederal is a subordinate hypothesis that must survive its own omission test.

Excluded takeovers: original Prada's bright neroli/geranium-style fougere direction; a generic sweet violet-vanilla iris; a leather-led Dior-style reinterpretation; smoky oud; blue shower gel; saffron leather; pastry tonka; laundry musk. These are design exclusions, not quantitative comparisons with measured references.

## 3. Functional architecture before doses

The nucleus is iris / amber / patchouli / tonka / sandalwood. Complexity is sought through relationships and changing access to that nucleus, not ingredient count.

| Layer | Primary ownership | Why it is present |
|---|---|---|
| Iris body | Alpha Isomethyl Ionone | Main floral-woody form; one physical AIMI stock, not two names counted twice |
| Iris facets | Alpha Irone; Alpha Ionone; Orris Liquid; Orivone | Respectively irone accent, violet-petal approach, product-specific root texture, dry root counterpoint |
| Interior warmth | Tonkarome; Coumarin; Heliotropal | Rounded tonka, dry hay-tonka articulation, restrained almond-powder connection |
| Foundation | Patchouli EO; Bacdanol; Ambrox Super | Earthy shadow, creamy sandalwood body, dry amber continuation |
| Connections | Kephalis; Cashmeran; Suederal | Woody transition, textile grain, subordinate suede seam; none is an independent theme |
| Space and finish | Hedione; Iso E Super; Benzyl Salicylate; Ambrettolide | Floral air, woody space, cosmetic cushion, one close soft musk |

Bacdanol was chosen for the sandalwood role and floral support described by [IFF](https://www.iff.com/scent/ingredients-compendium/bacdanol/). Kephalis provides a plausible woody-amber heart/base connection, not a documented Prada ingredient: [Givaudan](https://www.givaudan.com/fragrance-beauty/fragrance-ingredients-business/fragrance-molecules/kephalis). Ambrettolide's floral-fruity musk character is useful here only if it stays behind the iris; this is a blend hypothesis informed by [IFF](https://www.iff.com/scent/ingredients-compendium/ambrettolide/), not proof of performance.

## 4. Spatial, temporal and thirteen-plane design

Intended transition, NOT observed evaporation or smell:

Opening: a violet-petal edge reaches the iris before amber is fully legible.
Heart: iris remains the foreground; tonka and sandalwood become an interior, patchouli a darker boundary.
Late heart: powder changes from petal to dry root/textile; wood and subtle suede connect rather than replace the iris.
Drydown: tonka-sandalwood-amber warmth retains an iris trace with patchouli contrast. No numerical skin longevity is predicted.

| Deep plane | PLI-ASTRA-V1 hypothesis or evidence boundary |
|---|---|
| Identity | Intense reference anchors fixed above; no engine Intense-specific family contract found |
| Morphology | Iris foreground, warm interior, patchouli shadow, space around both |
| Function | One primary owner per row; support materials have defined failure/omission consequences |
| Relation | Iris-root/patchouli, iris/tonka and iris/sandalwood links are tested as relations, not independent score sums |
| Mixture | Exact weighed stock/product/carrier ledger; proprietary and natural internal composition unresolved |
| Temporal | Five-window modeled screen; blind observations are still required |
| Spatial composition | Foreground/interior/shadow map is a hypothesis, not a projected sillage measurement |
| Physicochemical | Density-free master accounting; modeled OAV uses uncertain registry inputs and a clearly separated volume surrogate |
| Biological sensitivity | No receptor activation, universal perceptibility, dermal safety, or anosmia claim from OAV |
| Hedonic | No score; blinded preference is distinct from target identity |
| Inventory build | Live worktree plus exact canonical user corrections, explicit new preparation tasks |
| Evidence authority | Sources, bytes, stock lineage and false downstream authority flags retained |
| Experiment | Protected nucleus; constant-total controlled omissions and one-musk alternative below |

Method source: docs/research/DHP2025_STRUCTURAL_FORMULATION_LEARNING_PROTOCOL.md and the unified target-neutral deep-plane runtime. These contribute structural questions, not a Dior ingredient recipe, donor lineage or sensory authority.

